        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>News, Notes, Quotes - November 1961</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #000;\n    background: #fff;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 30px 40px;\n  }\n\n  h1.main-title {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    text-align: left;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n\n  .top-columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .col {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n\n  .col h2 {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  .col p {\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n\n  .boxed-section {\n    border: 2px solid #000;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .boxed-section h2 {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .boxed-section p {\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-ads {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-box {\n    flex: 1;\n    border: 2px solid #000;\n    padding: 20px;\n    min-height: 420px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-left {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  .ad-left .bullet-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ad-left .bullet-list li {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-left .bullet-list li::before {\n    content: \"● \";\n  }\n\n  .ad-left .sketch-area {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 250px;\n  }\n\n  .sketch-caption {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 10px;\n    top: 30px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    width: 160px;\n    text-align: left;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .ad-left .company-name {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-left .company-address {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right {\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right h2 {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    margin-top: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .welcome-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .capitol-house {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    margin: 15px 0 5px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .convention-host {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .date-location {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .dot-separator {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    margin: 15px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .guest-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .hotels-title {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .hotel-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-align: left;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .hotel-list li {\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .ad-right .hotel-list li::before {\n    content: \"— \";\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder-img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 220px;\n    background: #f5f5f5;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1 class=\"main-title\">NEWS, NOTES, QUOTES . . . .</h1>\n\n<div class=\"top-columns\">\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <h2>Big Shoes to Fill—</h2>\n    <p>A toast to retiring Regional Director <em>Bert Brush</em> . . . . In his three years at the helm, his region has continued to advance effectively the interests of the profession. Fortunately his influence will still be felt by the Gulf States in his capacity as \"Mother to the New Director\". . . . a title Bert amiably tagged on his predecessor, <em>Gentleman John Pritchard</em> of the Tunica Hills.</p>\n\n    <h2>Progress on Association Film</h2>\n    <p><em>Frank Lotz Miller</em>, New Orleans architectural photographer, will assist LAA in production of a filmstrip depicting the work of the architect, what he can do for the client, how to select him, etc. <em>Miller</em> will make available from his collection, all slides which \"fit\" the script. The balance will be photographed by <em>Miller</em> and furnished to LAA at cost. <em>Bill Brockway's</em> Film Committee has completed the script and hopes to have copies to all seven chapters early in 1962.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <h2>Public Relations Effort by Crescent City Chapter</h2>\n    <p>The New Orleans Chapter has embarked on a vigorous public relations program, including retainage of professional public relations counsel and the beginning of a chapter publication. At the last chapter meeting, President <em>Murvan Maxwell</em> applauded the chapter PR Committee, under the leadership of <em>Lem McCoy</em>, for long hours of hard work dedicated to enhancing the image of the profession in the New Orleans area.</p>\n\n    <h2>Continue Membership on LAA Board of Governors</h2>\n    <p>The following have a one year term yet to serve on the Association's Board of Governors: <em>Ralph Kiper</em>, Shreveport; <em>Clifton C. Lasseigne</em>, Baton Rouge; <em>F. V. von Ostboff</em>, <em>August Perez III</em>, and <em>Carl Olschner</em>, New Orleans. Retiring President <em>W. J. Evans</em> will continue on the body as immediate past president. The four officers and seven new chapter presidents will complete the 1962 board membership.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col\">\n    <div class=\"boxed-section\">\n      <h2>AGC Says December 8 Bad Day for Bids</h2>\n      <p>The AGC is sponsoring the First Annual Construction Management Conference at LSU on December 8 and 9. Since December 8 is on Friday, the AGC respectfully requests that architects refrain from asking for bids on that date.</p>\n      <p>Your cooperation in this matter will permit AGC members to attend the conference in greater numbers.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>Next Month . . .</h2>\n    <p>LOUISIANA ARCHITECT will feature an article professing that \"Arbitration Is the Best Way to Settle Differences.\" Too many current victories in court eventually lead to immeasurable loss in public esteem after publicity has taken its toll.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bottom-ads\">\n  <div class=\"ad-box ad-left\">\n    <ul class=\"bullet-list\">\n      <li>curtain walls</li>\n      <li>acoustical panels</li>\n      <li>partitions</li>\n      <li>roof panels</li>\n      <li>solar screens</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"sketch-area\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder-img\" style=\"width:85%; height:220px; border:none; background:transparent;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 220\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n          <!-- Building sketch placeholder -->\n          <re